# 5. AUTHENTICATION (Ro'yxatdan o'tish & Kirish)

### 5.1 Foydalanuvchini ro'yxatdan o'tkazish (Register)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "shaxzod",
  "email": "shaxzod@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "firstName": "Shaxzod",
  "lastName": "Alijonov"
}

### 5.2 Tizimga kirish - Username orqali (Login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "shaxzod",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 5.3 Tizimga kirish - Email orqali (Login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "shaxzod@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 5.4 Noto'g'ri parol bilan kirish (400 Bad Request tekshiruvi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "shaxzod",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}

### 5.5 Tokenni yangilash (Refresh Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 5.6 Sessiyani bekor qilish / Logout (Revoke Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/revoke-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 6. EPISODES (Qismlar / Seriyalar)

### 6.1 Bitta qismni ID bo'yicha olish
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/episodes/1
Accept: application/json

### 6.2 Yangi qism qo'shish (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/episodes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 1,
  "number": 1,
  "title": "1-qism: Boshlanish",
  "videoUrl": "https://storage.movieflix.uz/videos/movie-1-ep-1.mp4"
}

### 6.3 Qismni yangilash (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/episodes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": 1,
  "title": "1-qism: Yangilangan sarlavha",
  "videoUrl": "https://storage.movieflix.uz/videos/movie-1-ep-1-hd.mp4"
}

### 6.4 Qismni o'chirish (Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/episodes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# 7. REVIEWS (Taqrizlar va izohlar)

### 7.1 Barcha taqrizlarni olish (Filtrlash va Paginatsiya)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&movieId=1
Accept: application/json

### 7.2 Bitta taqrizni olish (Daraxtsimon Replies bilan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/1
Accept: application/json

### 7.3 Yangi taqriz qoldirish (User / Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 1,
  "rating": 9,
  "comment": "Juda ajoyib film, hammaga tavsiya qilaman!"
}

### 7.4 Taqrizga javob (Reply) yozish
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 1,
  "parentId": 1,
  "comment": "Men ham to'liq qo'shilaman!"
}

### 7.5 Taqrizni yangilash
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 10,
  "comment": "Qayta ko'rib chiqdim, 10/10 film ekan!"
}

### 7.6 Taqrizni o'chirish
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# 8. USERS (Foydalanuvchilar va Profil)

### 8.1 Mening profilim (Get Profile)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 8.2 Mening profilimni yangilash (Update Profile)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "shaxzod",
  "email": "shaxzod@example.com",
  "firstName": "Shaxzodbek",
  "lastName": "Alijonov"
}

### 8.3 Parolni o'zgartirish (Change Password)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Password123!",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!",
  "confirmNewPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 8.4 Foydalanuvchilar ro'yxati (Admin - Pagination & Filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 8.5 Bitta foydalanuvchini ID bo'yicha olish (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 8.6 Foydalanuvchini yangilash va rolini o'zgartirish (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user_updated",
  "email": "user_updated@example.com",
  "firstName": "Ali",
  "lastName": "Valiyev",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### 8.7 Foydalanuvchini o'chirish (Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# 9. NOTIFICATIONS (Bildirishnomalar)

### 9.1 Mening bildirishnomalarim ro'yxati (Pagination & Filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 9.2 Faqat o'qilmagan bildirishnomalarni olish
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?isRead=false&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 9.3 Bitta bildirishnomani o'qilgan qilish (Mark as Read)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9.4 Barcha bildirishnomalarni o'qilgan qilish (Mark All as Read)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9.5 Admin: Ommaviy xabar yuborish (Broadcast)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/broadcast
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Yangi premyera!",
  "message": "Platformamizga yangi film yuklandi, tomosha qilishga shoshiling!",
  "extraData": "{\"movieId\": 1}",
  "type": 0
}



